---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — FixLanka Tools"
  description="FixLanka Tools is engineered with privacy at its core. Read our complete privacy disclosure regarding client-side processing and zero file retention."
  canonicalUrl="https://fixlanka.com/privacy"
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-8">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-medium px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 border border-brand-500/20">
        Privacy Disclosure
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-dark-text tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-dark-muted">
        Effective Date: November 2026 • Last Updated: November 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-dark-secondary leading-relaxed">
      <section class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark-text">1. Core Privacy Commitment</h2>
        <p>
          At FixLanka Tools (<a href="https://fixlanka.com" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 underline">https://fixlanka.com</a>), your privacy comes first. We believe personal files should never be sent to third-party servers when your own phone or computer can handle the task locally.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark-text">2. On-Device Local Processing</h2>
        <p>
          Every file-handling tool on FixLanka Tools—including the photo compressor, PDF tools, metadata viewer, privacy cleaner, and media tools—runs entirely inside your web browser.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-dark-secondary">
          <li>Your files are never uploaded to our web servers.</li>
          <li>Your files are never stored, logged, or cached on any remote disk.</li>
          <li>Temporary data created during processing lives only in your device's memory and clears immediately when you close the tab.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark-text">3. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We do not require accounts, passwords, email addresses, phone numbers, or payment methods for any tool. We never inspect, log, or read your files, text, or passwords.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark-text">4. Local Storage Usage</h2>
        <p>
          We use browser <code>localStorage</code> exclusively to remember your visual theme preference (Light or Dark mode). No tracking cookies or third-party ad trackers are embedded.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark-text">5. Hosting & Edge Infrastructure</h2>
        <p>
          FixLanka Tools is hosted via Cloudflare. Cloudflare may process standard web access logs (such as IP addresses and request timestamps) strictly for security protection and fast page delivery, in compliance with Cloudflare's privacy policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-dark-text">6. Changes to this Policy</h2>
        <p>
          If future optional features ever require network transmission, they will always be clearly marked and disclosed before you select any file.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border text-xs text-dark-secondary">
        <p class="font-semibold text-dark-text mb-1">Contact for Privacy Questions</p>
        <p>For questions regarding our privacy practices, reach us via our <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 underline">Contact Page</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>